#. module: outdoor_activities
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:outdoor_activities.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If you would like to learn more about the possibilities and options our "
"Events App offers, our official documentation has got you covered!"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມສາມາດ ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ແອັບ Events ຂອງພວກເຮົາມີໃຫ້, "
"ເອກະສານທາງການຂອງພວກເຮົາມີຄຳຕອບໃຫ້ທ່ານແລ້ວ!"

#. module: outdoor_activities
#: model_terms:event.event,description:outdoor_activities.event_event_1
#: model_terms:event.event,description:outdoor_activities.event_event_2
#: model_terms:event.event,description:outdoor_activities.event_event_3
#: model_terms:event.event,description:outdoor_activities.event_event_4
