#. module: outdoor_activities
#: model_terms:event.event,description:outdoor_activities.event_event_6
msgid ""
"Prior certification and diving experience required (open water and advanced/"
"deep diver certification, depending on agency requirements). By the end of "
"the course, you'll walk away with a recognized deep cave diving "
"certification 🏆 and the skills to explore some of the most breathtaking "
"underwater environments on earth."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ ແລະ ປະສົບການດຳນ້ຳມາກ່ອນ (ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ open water ແລະ advanced/deep diver, "
"ຂຶ້ນກັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງສະຖາບັນ). ເມື່ອຈົບຫຼັກສູດ, ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຮັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນການດຳນ້ຳຖ້ຳເລິກທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຍອມຮັບ 🏆 "
"ພ້ອມກັບທັກສະໃນການສຳຫຼວດສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃຕ້ນ້ຳທີ່ໜ້າຕື່ນຕາຕື່ນໃຈທີ່ສຸດໃນໂລກ."

