#. module: outdoor_activities
#: model_terms:event.event,description:outdoor_activities.event_event_5
msgid ""
"Ready to explore the underwater world? 🌊 Join us for our Open Water "
"Certification course and become a fully certified scuba diver in just a few "
"days!"
msgstr ""
"ພ້ອມທີ່ຈະສຳຫຼວດໂລກໃຕ້ນ້ຳແລ້ວບໍ່? 🌊 ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມຫຼັກສູດໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ Open Water ກັບພວກເຮົາ ແລະ "
"ກາຍເປັນນັກດຳນ້ຳ Scuba ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຢ່າງເຕັມຮູບແບບພາຍໃນບໍ່ເທົ່າໃດວັນ!"

#. module: outdoor_activities
#: model_terms:event.event,description:outdoor_activities.event_event_6
msgid ""
"Ready to take your diving to the next level? Join us for our Deep Cave "
"Certification course and discover one of the most exhilarating and technical "
"sides of scuba diving."
msgstr ""
"ພ້ອມທີ່ຈະຍົກລະດັບການດຳນ້ຳຂອງທ່ານຂຶ້ນອີກຂັ້ນແລ້ວບໍ່? ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມຫຼັກສູດໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ Deep Cave ກັບພວກເຮົາ ແລະ "
"ຄົ້ນພົບໜຶ່ງໃນດ້ານທີ່ຕື່ນເຕັ້ນ ແລະ ໃຊ້ເຕັກນິກສູງສຸດຂອງການດຳນ້ຳ Scuba."

