#. module: outdoor_activities
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:outdoor_activities.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Simplify your finances with the seamlessly integrated <strong>Accounting</"
"strong> app."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ເລື່ອງການເງິນຂອງທ່ານງ່າຍຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍແອັບ <strong>Accounting</strong> "
"ທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັນຢ່າງຄົບວົງຈອນ."

#. module: outdoor_activities
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:outdoor_activities.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Since you are using the integrated website, your contact form is configured "
"to automatically create an opportunity. <br/>\n"
"            A customer has filled it in and is inquiring about the "
"possibility of a Family Dive - how exciting! This section will take you "
"through all the steps to turn this request into a sale.<br/>\n"
"            First we open the <strong>CRM</strong>-App. There we see the new "
"request in the stage New."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກທ່ານກຳລັງນຳໃຊ້ເວັບໄຊທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັນ, "
"ແບບຟອມຕິດຕໍ່ຂອງທ່ານຈຶ່ງຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ສ້າງໂອກາດການຂາຍໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. <br/>\n"
"            ມີລູກຄ້າໄດ້ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນເຂົ້າມາ ແລະ ສອບຖາມກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມເປັນໄປໄດ້ໃນການດຳນ້ຳແບບຄອບຄົວ "
"(Family Dive) - ໜ້າຕື່ນເຕັ້ນຫຼາຍ! "
"ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ຈະພາທ່ານຜ່ານທຸກຂັ້ນຕອນເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍນີ້ໃຫ້ກາຍເປັນຍອດຂາຍ.<br/>\n"
"            ທຳອິດພວກເຮົາເປີດ <strong>ແອັບ CRM</strong>. "
"ຢູ່ທີ່ນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຈະເຫັນຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍໃໝ່ຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນ New (ໃໝ່)."

#. module: outdoor_activities
#: model:ir.actions.server,name:outdoor_activities.soft_dependency_server_action
msgid "Soft dependency"
msgstr "Soft dependency"

#. module: outdoor_activities
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:outdoor_activities.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Some customers might spontaneously decide to join you for a tour or an "
"event, instead of booking online in advance. This is where the POS-App "
"shines, which allows your customer to simply pay on the spot and join the "
"fun."
msgstr ""
"ລູກຄ້າບາງຄົນອາດຈະຕັດສິນໃຈເຂົ້າຮ່ວມທົວ ຫຼື ກິດຈະກຳກັບທ່ານຢ່າງກະທັນຫັນ ແທນທີ່ຈະຈອງອອນລາຍລ່ວງໜ້າ. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຈຸດເດັ່ນຂອງແອັບ POS ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າຂອງທ່ານສາມາດຊຳລະເງິນຢູ່ໜ້າຮ້ານໄດ້ງ່າຍໆ ແລະ "
"ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມຄວາມມ່ວນຊື່ນໄດ້ທັນທີ."

#. module: outdoor_activities
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:outdoor_activities.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Store and organize client information in the <strong>Contacts </strong>app."
msgstr "ຈັດເກັບ ແລະ ຈັດລະບຽບຂໍ້ມູນລູກຄ້າໃນແອັບ <strong>Contacts </strong>."

#. module: outdoor_activities
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:outdoor_activities.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Streamline billing and financial management with the <strong>Invoicing app</"
"strong>."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຄວາມຄ່ອງຕົວໃນການອອກໃບບິນ ແລະ ການຈັດການການເງິນດ້ວຍ <strong>ແອັບ Invoicing</"
"strong>."

#. module: outdoor_activities
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:outdoor_activities.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Streamline team management and integrate employees into every process using "
"the <strong>Employees</strong> app."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຄວາມຄ່ອງຕົວໃນການຈັດການທີມງານ ແລະ ເຊື່ອມໂຍງພະນັກງານເຂົ້າໃນທຸກຂະບວນການ ໂດຍນຳໃຊ້ແອັບ "
"<strong>Employees</strong>."

#. module: outdoor_activities
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:outdoor_activities.view_page_contactus
msgid "Submit"
msgstr "ສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ"

